@HostAddress = http://localhost:5220

### 1. Get All Users
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/User
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get User By ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/User/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create User with Document File (multipart/form-data)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/User
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="UserName"

BhavikParmar
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Password"

Password@123
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DocumentFile"; filename="sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

<binary-data-placeholder>
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### 4. Delete User Document Only (deleteFileOnly = true)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/User/1?deleteFileOnly=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Delete User and Document Completely
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/User/1?deleteFileOnly=false
Accept: application/json

###
